10. absolute value symmetry;
11. maximum left bound;
12. maximum right bound;
13. maximum commutativity;
14. finite addition closure;
15. finite subtraction closure;
16. finite multiplication closure;
17. finite division closure when denominator is nonzero;
18. clip below behavior;
19. clip above behavior;
20. clip inside behavior;
21. clipping preserves configured range;
22. valid clip bounds force exponential input between -20 and 20;
23. exponential positivity;
24. exponential nonzero;
25. exponential finiteness on bounded input;
26. square-root positivity for positive input;
27. Xavier bound positivity for positive dimension;
28. tolerance comparison accepts exact equality;
