34. out-of-range f16 conversion input returns `NumericFailure`.

Section 11: Tensor memory, cloning, zeroing, copying, all-close

Define tensor cloning, zeroing, copying, all-close comparison, temporary copies, overlap-aware copying, and equality preservation.

Prove individually:

