15. copying rejects alias when required;
16. overlap handling is correct;
17. temporary copy preserves original;
18. all-close reflexive;
19. all-close symmetric;
20. zero-tolerance all-close iff exact equality;
21. shape mismatch makes all-close false;
22. nonfinite compared value makes all-close false;
23. invalid tolerance returns `InvalidTolerance`.

Section 12: LayerCore structure and invariants

