Define optional tensor representation with absent and present variants.

Define complete layer validity predicate. Prove individually:

1. every field is defined with exact type;
2. gradient fields are optional tensors;
3. validity implies positive dimension;
4. validity implies valid clip range;
5. validity implies `s_weight` has shape `dim × dim`;
