14. absent gradients are allowed;
15. validity is preserved by parameter equality.

Section 13: LayerCore initialization, gradients, and deinitialization

Formalize exact initialization, including checked dimension multiplication, checked seed additions, Xavier bound, deterministic random uniform tensors, zero biases, absent gradients, and stored configuration.

Prove individually:

1. zero dimension returns `InvalidDimension`;
