37. pair validation succeeds iff pair is valid;
38. invalid first tensor returns `ShapeMismatch`;
39. invalid second tensor returns `ShapeMismatch`;
40. first tensor dimension mismatch returns `ShapeMismatch`;
41. second tensor dimension mismatch returns `ShapeMismatch`;
