Section 14: Translation-row semantics

Define translation-row computation exactly:

`translation[d] = t_bias[d] + sum over j from 0 to dim-1 of t_weight[d,j] * input[j]`.

Prove individually:

1. affine value definition;
2. translation row length equals dimension;
3. entry formula;
4. bias contribution;
5. weight contribution;
6. zero input equals bias;
7. finiteness under finite parameters and finite input;
